<title>INDIA: INDIA'S RBI MAINTAINS REPO CUT-OFF AT 3.6 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>INDIA'S RBI MAINTAINS REPO CUT-OFF AT 3.6 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it maintained the cut-off rate at 3.6 percent at Monday's repo auction.  </p>
<p>The RBI said it received two bids for 32 billion rupees, both of which it accepted in full.</p>
<p>The weighted average cut-off rate was 3.6 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91)-22-265 9000</p>
